basis = "All 62 member files were read in full against the brief and package requirements; findings propose repairs only and do not infer component test success from static review."
interface_review = "All 290 produced and 400 consumed registry rows were considered. Many rows describe declarations outside the member set or lexical caller matches rather than actual runtime dependencies. C/result-code, human HTTP, precompile and Solidity closure rows without member calls do not establish transports in this slice. Direct CLI/version calls, historical wire fixtures, middleware/wallet preparation, receipt resolution and runtime-clock producer/protocol/client paths were compared explicitly."
historical_boundary = "Inherited simd/Rosetta tooling and independent local ICS23 are not the paxd proof path; root go.mod selects published cosmos/ics23 v0.8.0 for confio imports. Historical maintenance/header vectors remain compatibility evidence under req.9312, and relay-archive mentions in absence guards are intentional negative assertions."
acceptance_boundary = "Requirement 22998.1 concerns executing recorded failed targets without weakened tests. This audit claims no component repairs or product-test qualification; the task evidence is limited to the declared audit-record and graph gate."

